FRUIT CATCHER — PRIVACY POLICY
================================
Effective Date: February 28, 2026
Last Updated: February 28, 2026


OVERVIEW
--------
Thank you for playing Fruit Catcher. Your privacy matters to us. This
Privacy Policy explains how the Fruit Catcher app ("the App") handles
information when you play our mobile game.

Fruit Catcher is a simple, offline game designed for players of all ages.
We are committed to full transparency about our data practices.


1. INFORMATION WE COLLECT
--------------------------
Fruit Catcher does NOT collect, store, or transmit any personal
information. We do not collect:

  - Your name, email address, or contact information
  - Location or GPS data
  - Device identifiers or advertising IDs
  - Photos, contacts, or any other device data
  - Usage analytics or behavioural tracking data
  - Payment information of any kind

The only data stored by the App is your high score, saved locally
on your device using standard device storage (AsyncStorage). This
data never leaves your device and is never accessible to us.


2. LOCAL STORAGE
----------------
Fruit Catcher stores the following on your device only:

  - Your best (high) score — to persist your achievement between
    sessions.

This data is stored using React Native AsyncStorage and is never
transmitted to any server, third party, or cloud service.


3. PERMISSIONS AND INTERNET ACCESS
------------------------------------
Fruit Catcher does not require any special device permissions. The
App does NOT request or use:

  - Internet access or network connectivity
  - Microphone access
  - Camera access
  - Access to contacts or calendar
  - Location services
  - Background processes

The App runs entirely offline. No internet connection is required
or used at any time.


4. CHILDREN'S PRIVACY
-----------------------
Fruit Catcher is suitable for all ages, including children under 13.
Because we do not collect any personal information from any user,
the App complies with:

  - Children's Online Privacy Protection Act (COPPA) — USA
  - General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) — EU
  - Equivalent children's privacy laws in other jurisdictions

We do not knowingly collect personal information from children or
adults. Parents and guardians can allow their children to use this
App with full confidence.


5. THIRD-PARTY SERVICES
------------------------
Fruit Catcher does not integrate any third-party services, including:

  - Advertising networks (no ads are shown in this App)
  - Analytics platforms (e.g. Firebase, Mixpanel, Amplitude)
  - Social media SDKs (e.g. Facebook, Google Sign-In)
  - Crash reporting services
  - Cloud storage or sync services

No third party has access to any data through this App because no
data is collected.


6. AUDIO AND SOUND
-------------------
All sounds in Fruit Catcher are generated programmatically inside
the App using synthesised audio. No audio recordings are made,
stored, or transmitted. The App does not access your microphone.


7. DATA SECURITY
-----------------
Since Fruit Catcher does not collect or transmit any personal data,
there is no personal data at risk. Your high score is held in your
device's local storage, protected by your device's own security.


8. CHANGES TO THIS PRIVACY POLICY
------------------------------------
We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes
will be reflected with an updated effective date. Because we do not
collect personal data or require account creation, we cannot notify
users directly of changes. Continued use of the App after any update
constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.


